AutoPresent/

# BLIND STUDY MATERIAL -- must never be public.
# The answer key maps item_NN -> source model + grader score. Publishing it unblinds the
# 48-slide human grading study before the raters have finished, which destroys the only
# human-anchored calibration evidence we have.
DO-NOT-SHARE-answerkey.json
*answerkey*.json
slide-grades-*.json

# The grading UI embeds 48 rendered slides, 16 of them from the PPTArena human-deck corpus
# (third-party research data), and is the live study instrument. Distributed directly to
# raters instead.
GRADE-48-SLIDES.html

